<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Derg</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">formed <a href="/years/1974">1974</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Derg was the military committee that seized power in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopia">Ethiopia</a>, formed in 1974. It deposed Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haile-selassie">Haile Selassie</a> that year, ending the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopian-empire">Ethiopian Empire</a> and the Solomonic monarchy, and went on to rule as a Marxist-Leninist regime that nationalised land and carried out widespread repression.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/derg.jpg" alt="Derg" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Thommy · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Ethiopia_(1974%E2%80%931975).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
